          "heading": "Bubble Brigade",
          "body": "The Bubble Brigade is a specialized clan of road rogues who operate under a single, unwavering philosophy: \"I am the only person currently in existence.\" Unlike villains who actively seek to cause chaos, the Brigade is defined by a complete and total lack of awareness. They don’t just ignore the rules of the road; they aren't even aware there are rules to the road. To a member of the Bubble Brigade, every other car is merely a glitch in their personal simulation.\n\nYou can spot a member of the Bubble Brigade by their total lack of eye contact. They do not look at mirrors, they do not look at traffic lights, and they certainly do not look at you as you lay on your horn.\n\nIn the grand rogue's gallery of rush hour, the Bubble Brigade is perhaps the most dangerous because you can't predict someone who doesn't even know you're there. They are the ultimate obstacles of the Rush Hour Villains clans.",
