              "ribbon": "Bubble Brigade",
              "note": "",
              "details": "",
              "cardStyle": "dark",
              "featured": true,
              "cta_linkLabel": "",
              "cta_linkType": "none",
              "cta_linkUrl": "",
              "cta_anchorId": "",
              "features": [
                {
                  "label": "Abilities",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Budget Stealth: By refusing to turn on his main headlamps, Ed becomes a ghost in the machine. He can merge, cut off traffic, and linger in blind spots entirely undetected by other drivers.",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": false
                },
                {
                  "label": "Bulb Preservationist: He prides himself on having the original factory-installed low-beam bulbs in a 15-year-old vehicle, despite the fact that his driving experience is akin to navigating via firefly light.",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": false
                },
                {
                  "label": "Special Weapons",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "DRL Glare: While his DRLs do nothing to illuminate the road ahead, they are just bright enough to be annoying to oncoming traffic, especially when he forgets they are on at 2:00 AM.",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": false
                },
                {
                  "label": "​\"Environmental\" Moral Superiority: He will argue loudly that he is \"preserving resources,\" completely ignoring the reality that he is a danger to every living thing on the road.",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": false
                },
                {
                  "label": "Weaknesses",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "The Sun: During the day, his strategy is indistinguishable from everyone else’s, which frustrates him deeply as he loses his unique \"identity.\"",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": false
                },
                {
                  "label": "​Insurance Premiums: The irony is not lost on anyone but Ed: the money he \"saves\" on bulbs is spent ten times over on deductibles for his constant, low-visibility fender benders.",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": false
                },
                {
                  "label": "Suggested Defense",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "If you see a car approaching in the dark with nothing but faint, squinty DRLs glowing, avoid eye contact and give him a wide berth. Trying to flash your high beams to signal him to turn his lights on will only confuse him, as he will likely mistake your alert for a friendly greeting. Just pull over, let him pass, and thank your lucky stars that his \"bulb savings\" don't include the cost of your car's bumper.",
                  "status": "",
                  "isGroup": false
                }
              ]
